WEBVTT

00:01.740 --> 00:04.060
This is just my wishful thinking,

00:04.060 --> 00:06.980
things look bad,
but the worst has yet to come.

00:08.020 --> 00:10.780
If she turned into All For One
or Dabi from the get-go,

00:10.780 --> 00:13.260
and then duplicated herself,
it'd be game over instantly.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.360
But she never did that.

00:16.660 --> 00:20.320
Therefore, we can start looking
for a way there!

00:21.060 --> 00:25.500
Twice's clones can use Quirks,

00:26.220 --> 00:29.140
but based on what you've learnt,

00:29.140 --> 00:33.280
Himiko can only use a Quirk
if she loves the person.

00:34.780 --> 00:36.300
In that case…

00:36.740 --> 00:39.240
Where could she be?

00:41.560 --> 00:42.840
Why?

00:43.260 --> 00:44.620
Why?

00:49.040 --> 00:52.440
I like Tomura and Toya too.

00:53.460 --> 00:57.760
But I can't use their Quirks
like I did with Jin and Ochaco.

00:59.780 --> 01:01.860
I really like them.

01:02.360 --> 01:05.120
So why can't I use their Quirks?

01:06.560 --> 01:09.740
Jin's Quirk works for me…

01:10.820 --> 01:12.540
So why can't I…

01:12.900 --> 01:15.360
become Jin?

01:18.040 --> 01:20.700
She likes to see the happy look
on others' faces.

01:21.840 --> 01:23.560
This is why she will never

01:26.940 --> 01:29.880
overlook anyone's tears.

01:46.870 --> 01:51.630
(My Hero Academia Season 7)

03:02.820 --> 03:04.410
(The Gunga Villa Site)

03:09.080 --> 03:10.920
Hang in there, Tsukuyomi!

03:10.920 --> 03:13.680
Keep him subdued! We need more time!

03:13.680 --> 03:16.340
He's probably invulnerable to damage
at the moment.

03:16.340 --> 03:17.800
But that won't last forever.

03:18.120 --> 03:21.940
He ended up this way
thanks to Endeavour's hit earlier.

03:22.360 --> 03:25.580
Subdue him at all costs!
We can't let him get away!

03:25.580 --> 03:27.420
Cover Dark Shadow!

03:27.420 --> 03:29.100
Block the light!

03:29.100 --> 03:31.180
Give it as much darkness as possible!

03:31.180 --> 03:33.960
I can create a night sky with aurora.

03:33.960 --> 03:36.160
I can do that with my Glamour Quirk!
Okay-okay?

03:37.100 --> 03:39.580
We need to stop Toga
from making more clones.

03:39.580 --> 03:44.040
I'm here to support everyone
in every direction!

03:58.740 --> 04:00.760
As I expected.

04:02.180 --> 04:05.340
Those who use brute force
are the real nuisance.

04:05.720 --> 04:07.600
He's become even younger.

04:13.540 --> 04:14.880
Here's the darkness.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.820
You're not going anywhere.

04:16.820 --> 04:20.140
Here's a gale to boost your speed.

04:20.140 --> 04:22.860
Don't let him get away!

04:29.000 --> 04:32.120
These two have realised it.

04:35.080 --> 04:38.760
The situation is perfect for them.

04:40.460 --> 04:43.100
Crush them, Machia.

04:44.820 --> 04:46.600
However…

04:47.120 --> 04:50.380
The worst has yet to come, am I right?

04:50.380 --> 04:51.920
Officer Tsukauchi?

04:58.940 --> 05:00.340
What?

05:05.980 --> 05:07.580
Pesky insects.

05:09.280 --> 05:12.100
We're here too, Tokoyami.

05:12.440 --> 05:15.460
We can't let that monster reach Midoriya!

05:15.790 --> 05:19.840
(It's A Small World)

05:20.300 --> 05:21.460
(Ten Minutes ago,
Confinement Facility of Gigantomachia)

05:21.460 --> 05:24.340
After receiving words of Dabi's arrest,

05:24.680 --> 05:27.860
Come on! Just when everything
was going peachy…

05:27.860 --> 05:31.620
My Softening Quirk is useless
against airborne targets.

05:32.220 --> 05:34.680
With this Ultrahigh-frequency generator

05:34.680 --> 05:39.120
and our Quirks,
the plan will come to fruition.

05:40.580 --> 05:42.880
We were the ones launching the assault.

05:43.120 --> 05:46.520
What are these guys doing here?

05:47.300 --> 05:50.100
Stand in our way all you want.

05:50.100 --> 05:52.360
It won't affect the plan at all.

05:52.940 --> 05:56.920
The high-frequency sound waves
are an imitation of All For One's voice.

05:57.300 --> 06:00.020
Not even the most impregnable
confinement facility

06:00.020 --> 06:02.900
can block off the sound waves.

06:03.680 --> 06:08.400
Machia will have no problem
hearing them with his Dog Quirk.

06:09.940 --> 06:11.120
Rule!

06:11.120 --> 06:12.240
Yes!

06:12.880 --> 06:14.300
Go big!

06:17.280 --> 06:20.340
We can't let them awaken Gigantomachia.

06:20.740 --> 06:22.840
We wouldn't want him awake.

06:23.720 --> 06:26.540
That guy is literally the manifestation…

06:32.200 --> 06:35.940
of psychological trauma.

06:38.020 --> 06:40.140
The escort mission was successful.

06:40.600 --> 06:42.440
While the villains were
divided and isolated,

06:42.440 --> 06:45.660
we secretly escorted Shinso here
without alerting anyone.

06:45.660 --> 06:48.720
We kept him hidden, away from the battles

06:49.200 --> 06:51.420
for this very moment.

06:51.760 --> 06:54.820
Shinso! Use Brainwash on Machia!

06:57.040 --> 06:58.580
Oh no.

06:58.580 --> 06:59.860
I've been made.

07:00.680 --> 07:03.220
Machia's awakening would mean victory.

07:03.220 --> 07:06.960
It's not worth it
to risk my neck for this fight.

07:07.340 --> 07:12.280
The remaining heroes these days
all have guts.

07:12.540 --> 07:17.500
So, I only pretended to fight
and sneaked away.

07:17.920 --> 07:20.380
But this peon has been
an even finer hiding spot

07:20.380 --> 07:23.520
than the brash kid
we nabbed in the forest.

07:24.680 --> 07:28.100
Weaklings always get hurt and squashed.

07:28.440 --> 07:30.480
It's the law of nature.

07:30.480 --> 07:32.780
Power is justice.

07:34.840 --> 07:38.100
The strong's actions are justified.

07:42.860 --> 07:46.880
Master, where are you?

07:46.880 --> 07:51.240
This marks the beginning
of the Liberation Era!

07:55.560 --> 07:57.720
Max Output.

07:59.800 --> 08:02.160
Acidman, Alma!

08:02.880 --> 08:04.420
Acid?

08:05.220 --> 08:08.220
The volume and concentration
enough to melt Machia's body?

08:08.940 --> 08:12.000
Watch it. Using that much acid…

08:13.140 --> 08:14.660
Back then,

08:15.580 --> 08:17.720
I couldn't pull this off.

08:18.680 --> 08:21.060
So many people lost their lives.

08:21.640 --> 08:24.160
Everything was destroyed in his wake.

08:25.580 --> 08:26.680
Which was why

08:27.140 --> 08:31.160
I asked Bakugo and Todoroki
to give me special training.

08:31.920 --> 08:34.970
Why? Because I've had enough of this.

08:36.200 --> 08:39.060
I'm tired of failing
to protect those dear to me.

08:40.160 --> 08:43.260
I can't stand it anymore!

08:45.180 --> 08:46.420
Acid?

08:46.420 --> 08:51.380
She took advantage of my fluid body
and mixed it with her acid!

08:51.700 --> 08:53.720
It's all getting mixed up.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.660
Stop right there!

08:55.660 --> 08:57.040
Get lost, fool!

08:57.040 --> 08:59.640
I'm siding with the winners.

09:05.560 --> 09:07.080
Thanks.

09:08.380 --> 09:11.580
The thought of revenge
would never cross Shoji's mind.

09:11.980 --> 09:13.220
Ashido.

09:13.660 --> 09:17.600
Midnight's lessons were my favourite.

09:19.100 --> 09:22.960
We know what it's like to be afraid
because we're weak.

09:23.240 --> 09:27.340
And because of that weakness,
we have each other's backs.

09:29.900 --> 09:32.080
That goes for all of us.

09:32.080 --> 09:34.320
We're all doing the same thing!

09:36.000 --> 09:38.360
We are comrades.

09:39.520 --> 09:41.520
Shout out all you want.

09:41.840 --> 09:43.600
The voice will never reach him.

09:43.600 --> 09:45.820
He is never going to stop.

09:45.820 --> 09:47.660
Machia.

09:47.660 --> 09:49.200
Master?

09:53.260 --> 09:54.820
The voice will reach him.

09:54.820 --> 09:58.640
That's why I learned this from Mr. Aizawa!

09:59.380 --> 10:00.960
Machia.

10:00.960 --> 10:03.880
Put an end to those in the air.

10:09.220 --> 10:12.640
I used my Personal Cords to recreate
All For One's voice based on

10:12.640 --> 10:14.720
the recordings from Tartarus.

10:15.300 --> 10:17.480
I only needed his response.

10:17.860 --> 10:20.660
There's no need to compete
with the frequency generator.

10:24.100 --> 10:27.480
Great work, Honenuki!
You showed them the strength in softness.

10:30.940 --> 10:32.200
Watch it.

10:32.800 --> 10:34.880
You are severely dehydrated.

10:36.920 --> 10:38.120
Ashido.

10:38.120 --> 10:39.500
Sorry.

10:39.500 --> 10:41.820
If I could do better just now…

10:43.240 --> 10:44.940
Kirishima…

10:49.480 --> 10:53.280
I think we're even now.

10:58.660 --> 11:00.880
You never owed me anything.

11:01.340 --> 11:03.800
You've always been my hero too.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.220
You fool.

11:08.740 --> 11:11.480
We stopped the enemies
from retaking Machia.

11:11.480 --> 11:14.600
Get ready to transport
the escaped convicts and villains.

11:17.360 --> 11:19.180
All For One is…

11:19.780 --> 11:20.110
(Makeshift Fortress Troy,
Coffin In The Sky)

11:20.110 --> 11:20.410
(Takoba National Stadium,
The Gunga Villa Site)

11:20.410 --> 11:20.760
(Okuto Island,
Confinement Facility of Gigantomachia)

11:20.760 --> 11:21.320
(Central Hospital
Kamino Ward: All Might Square)

11:21.860 --> 11:23.200
(The Gunga Villa Site)

11:23.200 --> 11:24.990
(The Present)

11:25.900 --> 11:27.480
This is a risky gamble.

11:29.580 --> 11:33.340
We went through a lot to create the links.
Don't let them get severed.

11:34.780 --> 11:37.980
Throw everything you have at All For One!

11:47.430 --> 11:49.020
(My Hero Academia
Pinky, Ashido Mina)

11:51.430 --> 11:53.020
(My Hero Academia
Hitoshi Shinso)

12:01.480 --> 12:03.480
What a bold tactic.

12:03.480 --> 12:06.440
Shinso is commanding Machia to attack
using his Brainwash Quirk.

12:06.680 --> 12:08.260
Which is why it's so risky

12:09.080 --> 12:11.220
even with Mt. Lady providing cover.

12:12.320 --> 12:16.620
So, this is how the Aoyama family
managed to deceive me.

12:17.500 --> 12:19.340
A controlling Quirk?

12:19.880 --> 12:22.720
Only I get to use that kind of power.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.520
Kirishima!

12:26.040 --> 12:29.820
Shinso's Brainwash Quirk
will disengage when he suffers damage.

12:30.400 --> 12:31.760
If that happens,

12:32.540 --> 12:35.660
the enemies will
regain control over Machia.

12:39.540 --> 12:42.040
You look different.

12:42.040 --> 12:44.200
But the scent never lies.

12:44.200 --> 12:45.940
I've been looking for you,

12:45.940 --> 12:48.020
All For One.

12:48.020 --> 12:49.580
My master!

12:52.420 --> 12:56.180
Why did you abandon me?

12:58.080 --> 13:00.660
Is Shinso making him say that?

13:01.100 --> 13:02.480
But he never reinitiated Brainwash

13:02.480 --> 13:04.780
after the impact just now.

13:04.780 --> 13:06.520
What's going on?

13:07.340 --> 13:10.460
My lovely Machia.

13:11.560 --> 13:14.440
I must go into hiding soon.

13:14.880 --> 13:20.000
But one day,
my successor will look for you.

13:21.000 --> 13:25.520
My greatest regret is that
I can't be there to spoil you anymore.

13:27.160 --> 13:28.800
Back then…

13:29.320 --> 13:31.500
My master's successor

13:31.500 --> 13:34.780
had All For One's scent and voice.

13:35.180 --> 13:37.020
I recognised them.

13:37.300 --> 13:40.960
It was indeed you.

13:41.580 --> 13:44.900
After I believed in you
and waited for so long,

13:45.180 --> 13:47.960
how could you abandon me

13:48.260 --> 13:50.520
and flee?

13:51.380 --> 13:53.960
Only Midoriya and this guy

13:54.560 --> 13:57.140
have been able to withstand my Brainwash
to this degree.

13:58.200 --> 14:00.600
Under the influence of the Quirk,
he seems to be talking in his sleep.

14:00.600 --> 14:02.940
He goes on and on
about his anger for the betrayal.

14:03.600 --> 14:05.060
Why?

14:05.060 --> 14:07.260
Why did you do it to me, Master?

14:07.260 --> 14:10.500
Why did you abandon me?

14:11.180 --> 14:14.720
All I'm doing is placing
a failsafe on top of his anger

14:14.720 --> 14:18.800
to keep this ride going!

14:21.640 --> 14:24.580
I'm used to people saying
this is what villains do.

14:24.920 --> 14:27.900
But my Quirk

14:27.900 --> 14:30.440
doesn't control the person's heart!

14:34.320 --> 14:40.180
It seems like no one wants
to go with your epic tale.

14:42.320 --> 14:44.540
Keep All For One pinned down

14:45.020 --> 14:46.920
until he perishes!

14:53.840 --> 14:55.380
(Airspace around Coffin In The Sky)
Make sure you don't

14:55.390 --> 14:56.940
(Airspace around Coffin In The Sky)
get in the way of this fight.

14:56.940 --> 14:59.830
(Airspace around Coffin In The Sky)
Yeah. I brought the best camera for this.

15:00.500 --> 15:03.640
I can get crisp and sharp images
even at a safe distance.

15:04.100 --> 15:07.240
But you must be out of your mind
to ask for a helicopter

15:07.240 --> 15:09.200
in this insane weather.

15:09.480 --> 15:11.420
I could say the same about you.

15:11.420 --> 15:15.280
I guess this is the primordial urge
to show how the story goes down.

15:16.300 --> 15:18.420
I had heard rumours about that boy in rags

15:18.700 --> 15:21.360
being a U.A. High student.

15:23.320 --> 15:26.600
I often review my old work,
so I remember it clearly.

15:27.540 --> 15:30.180
He was the same boy
from the sports festival.

15:31.080 --> 15:35.460
He was still trembling in his boots
just a year ago.

15:35.820 --> 15:37.100
Look at him now.

15:40.160 --> 15:43.780
We're not the only ones with the urges

15:43.780 --> 15:45.560
to get the right things done.

15:47.120 --> 15:49.960
Dispatching the helicopter
in this weather? Seriously?

15:49.960 --> 15:51.460
Have you lost your mind?

15:51.820 --> 15:54.300
Sorry for dragging you along.

15:54.300 --> 15:56.840
You didn't force me into anything.

15:58.080 --> 16:00.700
Gigantomachia's rampage

16:00.700 --> 16:03.080
was the reason my mother
was severely injured.

16:03.460 --> 16:07.720
It seems to me you don't realise
it happened because of your mistakes!

16:08.460 --> 16:12.000
I'm not doing this out
of my sense of duty but grudges.

16:12.900 --> 16:15.660
So, this is a personal matter.

16:16.380 --> 16:19.380
The company was shut down.
We never got paid a dime.

16:19.380 --> 16:21.860
I guess this doesn't
count as work after all.

16:24.040 --> 16:25.670
They are the same.

16:26.360 --> 16:29.670
(Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel)
It's not just Izuku Midoriya.

16:30.940 --> 16:33.980
There are people who aren't faltered
by the withdrawal of their comrades,

16:33.980 --> 16:37.400
those who choose to stay in the fight,

16:37.720 --> 16:41.500
and those who have no choice but to fight.

16:42.920 --> 16:46.940
Media outlets worldwide
are saying Japan is doomed.

16:46.940 --> 16:48.080
(Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel, Views)

16:48.080 --> 16:49.400
However,

16:49.400 --> 16:53.410
we can tell the world about those
who aren't giving up just yet.

16:53.410 --> 16:54.410
(Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel, Views)

16:54.900 --> 16:56.330
I want them to see this.

16:56.330 --> 16:57.330
(Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel, Views)

16:57.680 --> 16:59.460
Whether it ends with defeat or victory,

16:59.460 --> 17:00.460
(Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel, Views)
Whether it ends with defeat or victory,

17:01.340 --> 17:03.000
we'll show the world the whole story.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.000
(Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel, Views)
we'll show the world the whole story.

17:05.560 --> 17:07.630
We'll show it to the world

17:07.630 --> 17:08.840
(Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel, Views)
that became smaller with connections.

17:10.580 --> 17:13.000
We'll show them there's still hope.

17:15.480 --> 17:17.440
Where is Japan?

17:17.440 --> 17:19.000
I know about it.

17:19.420 --> 17:21.500
It's where All Might was from.

17:31.980 --> 17:33.580
I broke another one.

17:33.580 --> 17:34.640
Rule!

17:34.640 --> 17:37.440
We picked up stuff the villains dropped.

17:37.440 --> 17:39.880
Anything will do

17:40.520 --> 17:43.700
as long as we can keep
hitting the demon king!

17:48.700 --> 17:52.180
Sorry about this.
Supporting you is the best I can do here.

17:52.180 --> 17:55.340
Your support can give Baldur's Light
even more speed.

18:08.080 --> 18:09.190
Huh?

18:11.560 --> 18:13.200
Mt. Lady!

18:22.040 --> 18:23.940
Time to put you down,

18:25.440 --> 18:26.700
cursed creature.

18:28.340 --> 18:31.160
Perhaps it's the influence
of my other self.

18:31.900 --> 18:35.440
Dark thoughts are starting to brew in me.

18:38.340 --> 18:40.400
The younger I become,

18:40.760 --> 18:43.440
the harder it gets
to keep them suppressed.

18:52.320 --> 18:57.000
Simply following my instinct was enough
to unleash the potential of many Quirks.

18:57.740 --> 19:01.480
And that was enough
to generate this blinding light.

19:02.160 --> 19:03.360
Tokoyami!

19:03.360 --> 19:06.540
Keep attacking!

19:08.640 --> 19:10.060
Being young

19:10.400 --> 19:12.240
feels magnificent.

19:27.940 --> 19:30.760
The boy managed to push me
to such lengths.

19:33.060 --> 19:35.400
I am taking his Quirk.

19:36.700 --> 19:38.100
Move aside.

19:38.460 --> 19:40.900
You've put up a decent fight,

19:41.380 --> 19:42.860
Hawks.

19:47.400 --> 19:48.860
Fierce Wings.

19:49.260 --> 19:51.280
The Quirk factor is rotting.

19:52.300 --> 19:55.800
It's a wonder you even made it this far
with this garbage Quirk.

19:56.940 --> 20:01.120
Stocked Quirks are like external factors.

20:01.980 --> 20:05.900
They aren't affected by the Rewinding.

20:06.960 --> 20:08.460
What a load of nonsense.

20:09.320 --> 20:14.880
Every injury accelerates
the effect of Rewinding.

20:21.760 --> 20:24.680
Even if you take Dark Shadow,

20:24.680 --> 20:28.020
you're only turning yourself
into a cringey teenager.

20:28.920 --> 20:30.520
If you want,

20:30.520 --> 20:33.920
take my Pop Off instead.

20:33.920 --> 20:37.580
I guarantee you'll get the sickest hairdo.

20:37.580 --> 20:42.600
Don't you dare take Dark Shadow
from Tokoyami!

20:43.760 --> 20:45.420
Because of you,

20:45.420 --> 20:48.960
my friends are crying!

20:50.240 --> 20:52.460
The cries of the weak.

20:54.120 --> 20:56.820
I must make use of every second I have.

21:07.100 --> 21:08.320
Look up.

21:08.320 --> 21:10.160
A news chopper.

21:10.920 --> 21:13.560
After seeing this dreadful aftermath,

21:13.820 --> 21:16.740
the people will no doubt
lose faith in you heroes again.

21:18.640 --> 21:19.860
You have failed

21:20.440 --> 21:22.240
to protect anything.

21:22.580 --> 21:24.100
Heroes.

21:31.080 --> 21:34.060
Our mission is to take in
the refugees from U.A. High.

21:34.060 --> 21:37.460
We set up defences and keep them safe.

21:37.460 --> 21:39.620
But the refugees never arrived.

21:41.580 --> 21:42.920
Not yet…

21:45.380 --> 21:46.800
There is

21:47.420 --> 21:49.120
still hope…

23:20.130 --> 23:21.840
(Next Episode)

23:21.840 --> 23:23.300
Next episode.

23:23.960 --> 23:27.700
After passing the Quirk to me,

23:28.100 --> 23:30.140
he continued to fight
with the remaining embers

23:30.140 --> 23:31.500
and came out victorious.

23:31.500 --> 23:34.360
But now,
even that ember is slowly dying off.

23:35.140 --> 23:36.680
However, he is still alive.

23:37.360 --> 23:39.620
He is still fighting, defying fate.

23:40.080 --> 23:42.140
That's why he roars even now.

23:43.160 --> 23:45.980
Next episode, "I Am Here".

23:46.460 --> 23:48.320
(Next episode: I Am Here)
Go beyond.

23:48.320 --> 23:49.940
(Next episode: I Am Here)
Plus Ultra.
